The boolean [`worker.exitedAfterDisconnect`](https://nodejs.org/docs/latest/api/cluster.html#workerexitedafterdisconnect) allows distinguishing between voluntary and accidental exit, the primary may choose not to respawn a worker based on this value.
```
cluster.on('exit', (worker, code, signal) => {
  if (worker.exitedAfterDisconnect === true) {
    console.log('Oh, it was just voluntary – no need to worry');
