Global instance of [`https.Agent`](https://nodejs.org/docs/latest/api/https.html#class-httpsagent) for all HTTPS client requests. Diverges from a default [`https.Agent`](https://nodejs.org/docs/latest/api/https.html#class-httpsagent) configuration by having `keepAlive` enabled and a `timeout` of 5 seconds.
