####  `outgoingMessage.end(chunk[, encoding][, callback])`
History Version | Changes  
---|---  
v15.0.0 | The `chunk` parameter can now be a `Uint8Array`.  
v0.11.6 | add `callback` argument.  
v0.1.90 | Added in: v0.1.90  
