    * `detail`


The `process.emitWarning()` method can be used to emit custom or application specific process warnings. These can be listened for by adding a handler to the [`'warning'`](https://nodejs.org/docs/latest/api/process.html#event-warning) event.
```
import { emitWarning } from 'node:process';

// Emit a warning with a code and additional detail.
emitWarning('Something happened!', {
  code: 'MY_WARNING',
  detail: 'This is some additional information',
});
