  * `source` `0` for the main thread.


The `'workerMessage'` event is emitted for any incoming message send by the other party by using [`postMessageToThread()`](https://nodejs.org/docs/latest/api/worker_threads.html#workerpostmessagetothreadthreadid-value-transferlist-timeout).
#### Event: `'uncaughtException'`
History Version | Changes  
---|---  
v12.0.0, v10.17.0 | Added the `origin` argument.  
v0.1.18 | Added in: v0.1.18  
