The `vm.runInContext()` method compiles `code`, runs it within the context of the `contextifiedObject`, then returns the result. Running code does not have access to the local scope. The `contextifiedObject` object _must_ have been previously [contextified](https://nodejs.org/docs/latest/api/vm.html#what-does-it-mean-to-contextify-an-object) using the [`vm.createContext()`](https://nodejs.org/docs/latest/api/vm.html#vmcreatecontextcontextobject-options) method.
