  * `transferList` `MessagePort`-like objects are passed in `value`, a `transferList` is required for those items or [`ERR_MISSING_MESSAGE_PORT_IN_TRANSFER_LIST`](https://nodejs.org/docs/latest/api/errors.html#err_missing_message_port_in_transfer_list) is thrown. See [`port.postMessage()`](https://nodejs.org/docs/latest/api/worker_threads.html#portpostmessagevalue-transferlist) for more information.
