The event loop utilization of a worker is available only after the [`'online'` event](https://nodejs.org/docs/latest/api/worker_threads.html#event-online) emitted, and if called before this, or after the [`'exit'` event](https://nodejs.org/docs/latest/api/worker_threads.html#event-exit), then all properties have the value of `0`.
