In particular, this makes sense for objects that can be cloned, rather than transferred, and which are used by other objects on the sending side. For example, Node.js marks the `ArrayBuffer`s it uses for its [`Buffer` pool](https://nodejs.org/api/buffer.html#static-method-bufferallocunsafesize) with this.
