A `TransformStream` consists of a [<ReadableStream>](https://nodejs.org/docs/latest/api/webstreams.html#class-readablestream) and a [<WritableStream>](https://nodejs.org/docs/latest/api/webstreams.html#class-writablestream) that are connected such that the data written to the `WritableStream` is received, and potentially transformed, before being pushed into the `ReadableStream`'s queue.
