Following are some example addons intended to help developers get started. The examples use the V8 APIs. Refer to the online 
Each of these examples using the following `binding.gyp` file:
```
{
  "targets": [
    {
      "target_name": "addon",
      "sources": [ "addon.cc" ]
    }
  ]
} copy
```

In cases where there is more than one `.cc` file, simply add the additional filename to the `sources` array:
