####  `Blob` objects and `MessageChannel`
Once a [<Blob>](https://nodejs.org/api/buffer.html#class-blob) object is created, it can be sent via `MessagePort` to multiple destinations without transferring or immediately copying the data. The data contained by the `Blob` is copied only when the `arrayBuffer()` or `text()` methods are called.
