```

In each of the previous examples, an `Error` object is generated internally by `process.emitWarning()` and passed through to the [`'warning'`](https://nodejs.org/api/process.html#event-warning) handler.
```
import process from 'node:process';

process.on('warning', (warning) => {
  console.warn(warning.name);
  console.warn(warning.message);
  console.warn(warning.code);
  console.warn(warning.stack);
