#####  `tracing.enabled`
Added in: v10.0.0
  * `true` only if the `Tracing` object has been enabled.


####  `trace_events.createTracing(options)`
Added in: v10.0.0
  * `options`
    * `categories`
  * Returns: [<Tracing>](https://nodejs.org/api/tracing.html#tracing-object).


