######  `writable.write(chunk[, encoding][, callback])`
History Version | Changes  
---|---  
v22.0.0, v20.13.0 | The `chunk` argument can now be a `TypedArray` or `DataView` instance.  
v8.0.0 | The `chunk` argument can now be a `Uint8Array` instance.  
