A `TransformStream` consists of a [<ReadableStream>](https://nodejs.org/api/webstreams.html#class-readablestream) and a [<WritableStream>](https://nodejs.org/api/webstreams.html#class-writablestream) that are connected such that the data written to the `WritableStream` is received, and potentially transformed, before being pushed into the `ReadableStream`'s queue.
```
import {
  TransformStream,
} from 'node:stream/web';

const transform = new TransformStream({
  transform(chunk, controller) {
    controller.enqueue(chunk.toUpperCase());
  },
});

await Promise.all([
  transform.writable.getWriter().write('A'),
  transform.readable.getReader().read(),
]); copy
```

