An `IncomingMessage` object is created by [`http.Server`](https://nodejs.org/api/http.html#class-httpserver) or [`http.ClientRequest`](https://nodejs.org/api/http.html#class-httpclientrequest) and passed as the first argument to the [`'request'`](https://nodejs.org/api/http.html#event-request) and [`'response'`](https://nodejs.org/api/http.html#event-response) event respectively. It may be used to access response status, headers, and data.
