The following additional `options` from [`tls.connect()`](https://nodejs.org/api/tls.html#tlsconnectoptions-callback) are also accepted: `ca`, `cert`, `ciphers`, `clientCertEngine` (deprecated), `crl`, `dhparam`, `ecdhCurve`, `honorCipherOrder`, `key`, `passphrase`, `pfx`, `rejectUnauthorized`, `secureOptions`, `secureProtocol`, `servername`, `sessionIdContext`, `highWaterMark`.
