  * `flags`


The `'trailers'` event is emitted when a block of headers associated with trailing header fields is received. The listener callback is passed the [HTTP/2 Headers Object](https://nodejs.org/api/http2.html#headers-object) and flags associated with the headers.
This event might not be emitted if `http2stream.end()` is called before trailers are received and the incoming data is not being read or listened for.
