####  `module.findPackageJSON(specifier[, base])`
Added in: v23.2.0, v22.14.0
[Stability: 1.1](https://nodejs.org/api/documentation.html#stability-index) - Active Development
  * `specifier` [<URL>](https://nodejs.org/api/url.html#the-whatwg-url-api) The specifier for the module whose `package.json` to retrieve. When passing a _bare specifier_ , the `package.json` at the root of the package is returned. When passing a _relative specifier_ or an _absolute specifier_ , the closest parent `package.json` is returned.
