A successful call to [`run()`](https://nodejs.org/api/test.html#runoptions) method will return a new [<TestsStream>](https://nodejs.org/api/test.html#class-testsstream) object, streaming a series of events representing the execution of the tests. `TestsStream` will emit events, in the order of the tests definition
Some of the events are guaranteed to be emitted in the same order as the tests are defined, while others are emitted in the order that the tests execute.
#### Event: `'test:coverage'`
