####  `context.beforeEach([fn][, options])`
Added in: v18.8.0, v16.18.0
  * `fn` [`TestContext`](https://nodejs.org/api/test.html#class-testcontext) object. If the hook uses callbacks, the callback function is passed as the second argument. **Default:** A no-op function.
