  * `BROTLI_PARAM_LGBLOCK`
    * Ranges from `BROTLI_MIN_INPUT_BLOCK_BITS` to `BROTLI_MAX_INPUT_BLOCK_BITS`.
  * `BROTLI_PARAM_DISABLE_LITERAL_CONTEXT_MODELING`
